 msgid ""
 "<p>Open the <span class='knopfwort'>Import</span> tab. Android keeps every "
-"app's private database closed to other apps, so Magnolie Notes cannot simply "
-"look inside Samsung Notes, Google Keep or another notepad. Use an export "
+"app's private database closed to other apps, so Magnolie Notes cannot simply"
+" look inside Samsung Notes, Google Keep or another notepad. Use an export "
 "file, an export folder, or Android's Share command instead.</p><h3>Choose "
 "one file</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Tap <span class='knopfwort'>Choose "
-"file …</span>.</li><li>Select the export in Android's document picker.</"
-"li><li>Wait while <span class='knopfwort'>Reading …</span> is displayed.</"
-"li><li>Read the result before opening Notes.</li></ol><p>The picker "
-"initially allows every file type because Magnolie Notes examines the name "
-"and contents itself. A selected file may contain at most <b>64 MiB</b>. An "
-"unknown file can fall back to a plain-text note, so do not select a binary "
-"file merely because Android offers it.</p><h3>Choose a folder</h3><p><span "
-"class='knopfwort'>Choose folder …</span> reads suitable files in that folder "
-"and its subfolders. Text, Markdown, JSON, HTML, ENEX and supported ZIP-based "
-"exports are considered; unrelated suffixes and files over 64 MiB are "
-"skipped. Magnolie reads the selection immediately and does not remember "
-"access to the folder for later.</p><div class='achtung'><b>A complete "
-"desktop archive does not fit here</b>A <b>.magnolie</b> complete archive "
-"from Magnolie Organizer is deliberately rejected with <i>Complete archive "
-"import is not yet supported on this device.</i> Keep that archive for the "
-"desktop Organizer.</div>"
-msgstr ""
-"<p>Åbn fanen <span class='knopfwort'>Import</span>. Android holder hver apps "
-"private database lukket for andre apps, så Magnolie Notes kan ikke blot "
+"file …</span>.</li><li>Select the export in Android's document "
+"picker.</li><li>Wait while <span class='knopfwort'>Reading …</span> is "
+"displayed.</li><li>Read the result before opening Notes.</li></ol><p>The "
+"file picker offers supported note exports. Magnolie Notes also checks the "
+"actual contents and rejects binary data or invalid UTF-8 text. A selected "
+"file is limited to <b>64 MiB</b>; a text file outside an archive is limited "
+"to <b>8 MiB</b>.</p><h3>Choose a folder</h3><p><span "
+"class='knopfwort'>Choose folder …</span> reads supported files in the "
+"selected folder and its subfolders. Unrelated file suffixes are ignored. One"
+" import is limited to <b>5,000 examined files and subfolders</b>, <b>5,000 "
+"notes</b>, <b>six subfolder levels</b>, <b>64 MiB of input files</b> and "
+"<b>64 MiB of decoded note content</b> altogether. If a supported file cannot"
+" be read completely or a limit is exceeded, the whole folder import stops "
+"without saving new notes. Split the export into smaller selections and try "
+"again. Folder access is not retained for later.</p><div class='achtung'><b>A"
+" complete desktop archive does not fit here</b>A <b>.magnolie</b> complete "
+"archive from Magnolie Organizer is deliberately rejected with <i>Complete "
+"archive import is not yet supported on this device.</i> Keep that archive "
+"for the desktop Organizer.</div>"
+msgstr ""
+"<p>Åbn fanen <span class='knopfwort'>Import</span>. Android holder hver apps"
+" private database lukket for andre apps, så Magnolie Notes kan ikke blot "
 "kigge i Samsung Notes, Google Keep eller en anden noteapp. Brug i stedet en "
-"eksportfil, en eksportmappe eller Androids Del-kommando.</p><h3>Vælg én fil</"
-"h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Tryk på <span class='knopfwort'>Vælg fil …</"
-"span>.</li><li>Vælg eksporten i Androids dokumentvælger.</li><li>Vent, mens "
-"<span class='knopfwort'>Læser …</span> vises.</li><li>Læs resultatet, før du "
-"åbner Noter.</li></ol><p>Vælgeren tillader først alle filtyper, fordi "
-"Magnolie Notes selv undersøger navn og indhold. En valgt fil må højst være "
-"<b>64 MiB</b>. En ukendt fil kan ende som en almindelig tekstnote, så vælg "
-"ikke en binær fil, blot fordi Android tilbyder den.</p><h3>Vælg en mappe</"
-"h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>Vælg mappe …</span> læser egnede filer i "
-"mappen og dens undermapper. Tekst, Markdown, JSON, HTML, ENEX og "
-"understøttede ZIP-baserede eksporter tages i betragtning; uvedkommende "
-"endelser og filer over 64 MiB springes over. Magnolie læser valget straks og "
-"husker ikke adgangen til mappen.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Et komplet "
-"skrivebordsarkiv passer ikke her</b>Et komplet <b>.magnolie</b>-arkiv fra "
-"Magnolie Organizer afvises bevidst med <i>Import af komplette arkiver "
-"understøttes endnu ikke på denne enhed.</i> Gem arkivet til Organizer på "
-"skrivebordet.</div>"
+"eksportfil, en eksportmappe eller Androids Del-kommando.</p><h3>Vælg én "
+"fil</h3><ol class='schritte'><li>Tryk på <span class='knopfwort'>Vælg fil "
+"…</span>.</li><li>Vælg eksporten i Androids dokumentvælger.</li><li>Vent, "
+"mens <span class='knopfwort'>Læser …</span> vises.</li><li>Læs resultatet, "
+"før du åbner Noter.</li></ol><p>Filvælgeren tilbyder understøttede "
+"noteeksporter. Magnolie Notes kontrollerer også det faktiske indhold og "
+"afviser binære data eller ugyldig UTF-8-tekst. En valgt fil må højst fylde "
+"<b>64 MiB</b>; en tekstfil uden for et arkiv må højst fylde <b>8 "
+"MiB</b>.</p><h3>Vælg en mappe</h3><p><span class='knopfwort'>Vælg mappe "
+"…</span> læser understøttede filer i den valgte mappe og dens undermapper. "
+"Andre filendelser ignoreres. Én import er samlet begrænset til <b>5.000 "
+"undersøgte filer og undermapper</b>, <b>5.000 noter</b>, <b>seks "
+"undermappeniveauer</b>, <b>64 MiB inputfiler</b> og <b>64 MiB afkodet "
+"noteindhold</b>. Hvis en understøttet fil ikke kan læses helt, eller en "
+"grænse overskrides, stopper hele mappeimporten uden at gemme nye noter. Del "
+"eksporten op i mindre udvalg, og prøv igen. Adgang til mappen bevares ikke "
+"til senere.</p><div class='achtung'><b>Et komplet skrivebordsarkiv passer "
+"ikke her</b>Et komplet <b>.magnolie</b>-arkiv fra Magnolie Organizer afvises"
+" bevidst med <i>Import af komplette arkiver understøttes endnu ikke på denne"
+" enhed.</i> Gem arkivet til Organizer på skrivebordet.</div>"
 
